{"id": "63384", "title": "欧阳少恭的心上人", "author": "莲妖银夜", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 26, "available": 12, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/63/63384.htm", "intro": "我曾经以为，一个女人，能在一个男人心底拥有独一无二的位置，是一件非常荣耀而值得铭刻终生的事情。等到我自己遇到了这种事，我才知道——根本就不是那么回事！“如果有一天，你发现，一个男人心底最深处有你的位置，你是什么感觉？”“如果有一天，你发现，自己就像死神里的虚一样，寄生在别人灵魂深处，你是什么感觉？”“如果有一天，你发现，很凑巧的，被你寄生的这位，叫做欧阳少恭，你是什么感觉？”我深深地憔悴了。“……人生真是寂寞如雪。”", "base": "files/article/html/63/63384", "chapters": [{"title": "住进BOSS心坎里", "file": "9370473.html", "available": false}, {"title": "上帝你好", "file": "9370475.html", "available": false}, {"title": "虚子在此", "file": "9370477.html", "available": false}, {"title": "乱发好人卡", "file": "9370479.html", "available": false}, {"title": "嬉笑人生", "file": "9370480.html", "available": false}, {"title": "天纵英才", "file": "9370481.html", "available": false}, {"title": "真妹子", "file": "9370484.html", "available": false}, {"title": "倾国倾城貌", "file": "9370485.html", "available": false}, {"title": "铜豌豆", "file": "9370487.html", "available": false}, {"title": "情场失意", "file": "9370488.html", "available": false}, {"title": "高山流水", "file": "9370493.html", "available": false}, {"title": "有美一人", "file": "9370495.html", "available": false}, {"title": "幻暝梦境", "file": "9370497.html", "available": false}, {"title": "五年一日", "file": "9370499.html", "available": false}, {"title": "天劫难渡", "file": "9370501.html", "available": true}, {"title": "末日狂欢", "file": "9370503.html", "available": true}, {"title": "回音不复", "file": "9370505.html", "available": true}, {"title": "天道无情", "file": "9370507.html", "available": true}, {"title": "道友请留步", "file": "9370509.html", "available": true}, {"title": "女子难养", "file": "9370510.html", "available": true}, {"title": "人生何处不相逢", "file": "9370511.html", "available": true}, {"title": "指间七弦错", "file": "9370514.html", "available": true}, {"title": "曲调难合", "file": "9370516.html", "available": true}, {"title": "命犯桃花", "file": "9370518.html", "available": true}, {"title": "不死不休", "file": "937052